# SKID KIDS: the tournament can be won. The demo player drives your kid
# with real button presses every frame, from the title on: it drafts, jumps
# every bag it sees in time, keeps back from a rival with a bag, camps by
# the line where the Coach's items land and the rivals come running, and
# throws short (a light toss at point blank, a quick one at a rival bent
# over a bag or winding up). Your partner is the ordinary partner. Over
# several seeds it wins all six matches.
seed 9
game skidkids
wait 20
botuntil state >= 9 400000
expect state == 10
expect wins == 6
expect goals & 2
